# ── Extracted from the game ───────────────────────────────────────
# Not committed. It is the game's own text, or derived from it, and anyone with a
# copy of the game can make it again with tools/.
generated/i18n.en.json
# The seed is the English text copied into a translation scaffold - the game's words
# either way, so it is no more committable than the file it comes from.
generated/i18n.ko.seed.json
generated/dialogs/
extracted/

# generated/fingerprint.json is deliberately NOT here. It is our own record of which
# game builds were verified, not anything taken out of the game, and the README and the
# release notes both read from it.

# ── Runtime output ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The watchdog writes these as it goes. They are a record of play rather than
# anything to publish, and leaving them makes the repository dirty on every run.
snapshots/
doctor.txt
*.log

# ── Build ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/target/
dist/
*.pdb

# ── Python ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The translation sources and the site generator are Python modules, so importing one
# leaves a byte-compiled copy beside it. Those are per-interpreter-version and were
# being committed.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# ── The site ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# docs/ is the GitHub Pages *source*. What Jekyll makes from it is not.
docs/_site/
docs/.jekyll-cache/
docs/.jekyll-metadata
.bundle/
vendor/bundle/

# ── Node ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# There are no runtime dependencies. A lint tool would land here.
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# ── Editors, agents and operating systems ─────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.claude/

# ── Never, on a public repository ─────────────────────────────────
# Nothing here is expected to exist; the rules are so that a slip does not become a
# commit. A save file is somebody's account, and a key is a key.
*.pem
*.key
.env
.env.*
secrets.*
saves/
*.sav
